          "written": true
        },
        {
          "speaker": "自分",
          "text": "0 と 1 が 8 つ。教授の言っていた 1 バイトだ。",
          "text_en": "Eight 0s and 1s. The one byte the professor talked about."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "自分",
          "text": "隅の A と見比べると、違うのは右の 4 けただけ。A から 7 つ先……H だ。",
          "text_en": "Compared with the A in the corner, only the last four digits differ. Seven after A... it's H."
        }
      ]
